{
  "id": "gcp-cloud-run-service",
  "title": "部署並管理 Cloud Run 服務",
  "description": "用 Google 提供的範例容器部署 Cloud Run 服務，設定誰可以呼叫、用環境變數建立新的修訂版本、限制最多執行個體，最後刪除服務。",
  "provider": "gcp",
  "estimatedMinutes": 15,
  "initialState": {
    "files": {},
    "cloud": {}
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "instruction": "在 asia-east1 部署服務 hello，映像檔用 us-docker.pkg.dev/cloudrun/container/hello。先不要加 --allow-unauthenticated，看看輸出裡的服務網址。",
      "hint": "gcloud run deploy hello --image=us-docker.pkg.dev/cloudrun/container/hello --region=asia-east1",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "gcp",
          "run",
          "services",
          "hello",
          "region"
        ],
        "equals": "asia-east1"
      }
    },
    {
      "instruction": "這個服務目前只有擁有 roles/run.invoker 的身分能呼叫。把它公開給所有人。",
      "hint": "gcloud run services add-iam-policy-binding hello --region=asia-east1 --member=allUsers --role=roles/run.invoker（也可以用 gcloud run services update hello --region=asia-east1 --no-invoker-iam-check）",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "gcp",
          "run",
          "services",
          "hello",
          "public"
        ],
        "equals": true
      }
    },
    {
      "instruction": "加上環境變數 GREETING=hello。修改設定會建立新的修訂版本，用 gcloud run revisions list --region=asia-east1 看看現在有幾個。",
      "hint": "gcloud run services update hello --region=asia-east1 --update-env-vars=GREETING=hello",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "gcp",
          "run",
          "services",
          "hello",
          "env",
          "GREETING"
        ],
        "equals": "hello"
      }
    },
    {
      "instruction": "為了避免流量暴增時費用失控，把最多執行個體從預設的 100 改成 5。",
      "hint": "gcloud run services update hello --region=asia-east1 --max-instances=5",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "gcp",
          "run",
          "services",
          "hello",
          "maxInstances"
        ],
        "equals": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "instruction": "練習結束，刪除服務 hello。",
      "hint": "gcloud run services delete hello --region=asia-east1",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "gcp",
          "run",
          "services",
          "hello"
        ],
        "exists": false
      }
    }
  ]
}
